# Exception (2026-09-10): the whole paper-data folder is released with the repo.
# It holds the results file, every calibration JSON, the Q0057/Q0058 manifests,
# the reviewer-response and verification JSONs, the 2026-09-10 probe outputs and
# the paper figures (12 MB, no .npy/.npz). Backups and checkpoints stay out.
!data/paper/
!data/paper/**
data/paper/**/*.bak*
data/paper/**/_bak/
data/paper/**/_*checkpoint*.json
data/paper/reproduce_status.json

